  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & f(x)=\\max \\cdot\\{x+|x|, x-[x]\\}=\\max \\{x+|x|,\\{x\\}\\} \\\\ & \\int_{-3}^3 f(x) d x \\\\ & =\\int_{-3}^0\\{x\\} d x+\\int_0^3 2 x d x \\\\ & =\\frac{3}{2}+9=\\frac{21}{2}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
